            "InputQueryIntraChainBond": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "description": "Input defining a single bond between two atoms in the same chain.\n\nEach endpoint of the bond requires a specification of a residue (either by residue ID\nor residue index) and an atom (either by atom name or atom index). Optionally, a leaving\natom can be specified for each endpoint, which defines an atom which will be removed\nfrom the structure (for example, OXT atoms are removed from the C-terminal residue\nof an amino acid).",
